          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi abakoDani sebelahlekelwe yilizwe labo, basuka bayahlasela iLeshema; sebelithumbile balichitha ngomkhonto, bahlala kilo, babiza iLeshema ngokuthi yiDani, ibizo likakhokho wabo uDani.",
